<title>SPAIN: SPANISH BONDS END QUIET SESSION HIGHER.</title>
<headline>SPANISH BONDS END QUIET SESSION HIGHER.</headline>
<text>
<p>1530 GMT - Government bonds ended a quiet session higher, letting other markets lead given little domestic impetus.</p>
<p>* 10-yr 7.35 pct T-bond 107.06 vs 106.91, yield 6.34 vs 6.36</p>
<p>* Sept bond future 116.63 vs 116.42 at yesterday's close</p>
<p>* Peseta/mark 84.39/41 vs 84.39/41</p>
